# Cloudflare Pages deploy (HCCC)

This project’s live site is Cloudflare Pages.

- **Project name:** `hccc-carigara`
- **Production URL:** https://hccc-carigara.pages.dev
- **Deploy command (preferred on Windows):** `npm.cmd run pages:deploy`
- **Or double-click / run:** `deploy.cmd`
- Avoid plain `npm` in PowerShell when ExecutionPolicy blocks `npm.ps1`.

## Required agent behavior

After finishing any user-requested change that affects the website (UI, content, styles, config, images, functions), **deploy to Cloudflare Pages before ending the turn**, unless the user explicitly says not to deploy.

1. On Windows, run `npm.cmd run pages:deploy` (or `.\deploy.cmd`) from the project root.
2. Confirm the production URL https://hccc-carigara.pages.dev in the reply.
3. If deploy fails due to auth, run `npx wrangler login`, then retry deploy.
4. Do not deploy for pure Q&A, planning-only turns, or when the user only asked for local review.

## Notes

- Static export output is `out/`; Pages Functions live in `functions/`.
- Production site URL is set in `.env.production` as `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`.
- Never use netbank-related project/domain names; keep HCCC naming (`hccc-carigara`).
